    "sub_name": "金融時事導讀",
    "sub_ename": "GUIDED READING OF FINANCIAL NEWS",
    "describe_ch": "通過閱讀近期金融相關新聞，學習解讀經濟和投資趨勢；提高問題思維和邏輯推理能力，並應用已經學會的金融理論來預測投資和金融決策的未來趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "Through reading the recent financial-related news to learn interpret economic and investment trends; to improve problem thinking and logical reasoning abilities, and applying financial theories that already learned to predict future trends in investment and financial decisions.",
